    {
      "id": "90a6e8a8-22cd-45d2-b570-0d18e091f58c",
      "title": "Escute e leia a frase. Ligue los lunes ao sentido em português.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "6630a3dd-f092-4714-be61-3ed14c5707bb",
          "textContent": "<p>Escute e leia.</p><p><strong>Los lunes estudio en la biblioteca.</strong></p><p>Em português: Às segundas-feiras estudo na biblioteca.</p><p><strong>los lunes</strong> = às segundas-feiras</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/a9433a09275646af89cbe7543b7f9587_los-lunes-estudio-en-la-biblioteca.mp3?Expires=1794099465&Signature=N6gxOu6QWUXfLhCLfhx9-yRKYu5kkGy~ngpu5sUVngneFzp-499rbIw6S8vhcvMXhnaH0RCq66cFZw8B~EJKxjg4zikXvyI8xyRXkdHtCxkoX2DY3ZgneEwVEA-4ww3OM0olzQkqhOrEE9zgNq5llrlcYbmk~4GKAOPsRz82CX~0xc5yA~W8W0oIWEcRiFOIPd-TAvWJ2wPlTnQY0MYVBF0SsPf1O2c6L~tOWBw8c919BX8R2dfPGaplLUz5GuwpCju-U2kS0IOQ52Z4ssOHW8fwxcZKruwdhFRIAWcSAWh3XWQOy2u5AD16HWQgEG4jhRNLlxlb4AYvxkOTdtM6ig__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
