    {
      "id": "b93acf26-24cb-48e3-a1fe-dc374809370c",
      "title": "Compare as duas frases e observe a parte que fica estável.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "7e771080-fc71-489e-bb9d-689b0499e7f0",
          "textContent": "<p>As duas frases usam o mesmo molde para rotina semanal.</p><ul><li><strong>Los lunes</strong> estudio en la biblioteca.</li><li><strong>Los martes</strong> trabajo en casa.</li></ul><p>Quando a ideia se repete toda semana, o espanhol costuma usar <strong>los + día</strong>.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "9963c8be-63bf-4e13-adfc-12ee3aa7ae43",
      "title": "Escute e leia a frase. Note a troca de los para el.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 6,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "14854850-5399-4b50-a9a2-85f035d435c2",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora a frase fala de um dia específico.</p><p><strong>El miércoles descanso por la tarde.</strong></p><p>Em português: Na quarta-feira descanso à tarde.</p><p><strong>el miércoles</strong> = na quarta-feira</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/13c5760e566649c981dc387c84c7e31a_el-miercoles-descanso-por-la-tarde.mp3?Expires=1794099465&Signature=mzqaddZSyaFQqG-GT63OygAVjND5pbVdNNRjJEFHAy94yEU02Jeg75EJd7JRlvNLD4GALrAf1PY4g9bWG0agyrK30BeWWarNZZaRoOOFiBzojzYmU50mrVYZTe1MdKTChBReQp4GY~tVfJdeY7yWE68gfycMBgADlqdOHuwZqB~SA5qsiigdKTcJgchP2DH66XYP5NLnEFRWWJKB9AhT~Emp8J9LUdtejn77FBUIKcJM7fo851armT8ocQNZeo~KhsbiqJ4TV~fFw2fO-lukTgelXaiDF7SWBXBGra-Cr-pZIQh5yAoLhb8YDTt7-vZWbWHJ4hDErGSGM--XLO1xDw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
